> sd3(a: i32 in 0..1000) = a / 7 + 300
> find sd3 1
find sd3: 1001 points, computing in i32, costs from gt1030
  rewrites the model prices lower (each derived, with what it holds under):
  cost 10  i32(u32(a)/7) + 300                      the signed division a/7 as u32 (its operands are never negative) (derived; checked on every point)
      holds where a >= 0 (a in [0, 1000]: its range) and 7 >= 1 (7 in [7, 7]: a constant)
      a / 7 on i32 truncates toward zero; with the dividend >= 0 and the divisor >= 1 the quotient is >= 0, so trunc(a/b) = floor(a/b)
      0 <= a, b < 2^31: as u32 they are the same numbers, and the unsigned quotient floor(a/b) (at most a < 2^31) converts back to i32 unchanged
  cost 6   i32(1171u32(a) >> 13) + 300              the division a/7 as a multiply and a shift in u32 (derived; checked on every point)
      holds where a in [0, 1000] (its range)
      M = ceil(2^13/7) = 1171, so M*7 = 2^13 + 5
      x*M/2^13 = x/7 + x*5/(7*2^13): the excess is below 1/7 while x*5 < 2^13, and x/7 is at least 1/7 below the next integer, so floor(x*M/2^13) = floor(x/7)
      x <= 1000: x*5 <= 5000 < 2^13, and x*M <= 1171000 < 2^32, so the product does not wrap in u32
  cost 8   i32(0.142857149f32(a)) + 300             a/7 on the f32 pipe: the conversion of f32(a) * 0.142857149 (1/7 rounded up to an f32) (derived; checked on every point)
      holds where a in [0, 1000], inside [0, 2^24), and 1000 (0.142857149 - 1/7) + ulp/2 < 1/7: 6.39e-06 + 7.63e-06 < 0.143
      a < 2^24 converts to f32 exactly
      0.142857149 = 0x1.24924ap-3 is 1/7 rounded up to an f32, above it by 6.39e-09
      q0 = floor(a/7) is an integer below 2^24, an f32, and f32(a) * 0.142857149 >= a/7 >= q0: the product rounded to nearest is not below q0
      a/7 <= q0 + 6/7, so the exact product is at most q0 + 6/7 + 6.39e-06 (1000 times the excess); it is below 256, where rounding adds at most 7.63e-06: it stays below q0 + 1, as 6.39e-06 + 7.63e-06 < 1/7
      the conversion to i32 truncates toward zero: of a value in [q0, q0 + 1) it is q0 = a / 7
  cost 5   i32(585u32(a) + 1228942 >> 12)           the map a/7 + 300 of a as a multiply and a shift in u32 (derived; checked on every point)
      holds where a in [0, 1000] (its range)
      a/7 + 300 at a = 0..1000 is [300, 300, 300, 300, 300, 300, 300, 301, 301, 301, 301, 301, 301, 301, 302, 302, ... (985 more)] (evaluated at each of the 1001)
      with i = a, M = 585 and A = 1228942: each value w has w*2^12 <= i*M + A < (w + 1)*2^12 (the closest: 0 above at a = 994, 443 below at a = 6), so (i*M + A) >> 12 is w
      i*M + A stays in 0..1814527, inside u32: computed mod 2^32 from a itself, as a*0x249 + 0x12c08e, it is the same number
